{"id":"0add8a5835559b4b","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-well-order-enumeration.md","title":"序数类的递增枚举","display":"df-well-order-enumeration — 序数类的递增枚举","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-well-order-enumeration","aliases":["18-df-well-order-enumeration"],"display":"df-well-order-enumeration — 序数类的递增枚举","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Lemmas 3.2.11–3.2.12","source_pages":"26","source_pdf_pages":"36","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","prior_revision_verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-well-order-enumeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-well-order-enumeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-well-order-enumeration — 序数类的递增枚举"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f91b518237a8b\" href=\"?note=592f91b518237a8b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-comparison\">18-df-ordinal-comparison</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Lemmas 3.2.11–3.2.12"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"26"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"36"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 是给定集合或可定义类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 是可定义部分类函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord},&lt;\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord},&lt;\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"592f91b518237a8b\" href=\"?note=592f91b518237a8b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-comparison\">18-df-ordinal-comparison</a>。类图的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span> 是元语言缩写，真类不作为 ZFC 集合变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in\\)</span> 明确表示集合序同构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otp}\">\\(\\operatorname{otp}\\)</span> 是该唯一序数的可定义类函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Enum}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Enum}(X)\\)</span> 是下式的类图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in(\\alpha,A,h)\\longleftrightarrow\nh:\\alpha\\xrightarrow{\\sim}A\\land\n\\forall\\xi,\\eta\\in\\alpha\\;(\\xi\\in\\eta\\leftrightarrow h(\\xi)\\in h(\\eta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in(\\alpha,A,h)\\longleftrightarrow\nh:\\alpha\\xrightarrow{\\sim}A\\land\n\\forall\\xi,\\eta\\in\\alpha\\;(\\xi\\in\\eta\\leftrightarrow h(\\xi)\\in h(\\eta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otp}(A,\\in)\\coloneqq\\iota\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in(\\alpha,A,h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{otp}(A,\\in)\\coloneqq\\iota\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in(\\alpha,A,h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncEnum}(X,e)\\longleftrightarrow\n[(\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\operatorname{dom}(e)=\\delta)\\lor\\operatorname{dom}(e)=\\mathrm{Ord}]\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(e)=X\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{dom}(e)\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to e(\\alpha)&lt;e(\\beta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IncEnum}(X,e)\\longleftrightarrow\n[(\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\operatorname{dom}(e)=\\delta)\\lor\\operatorname{dom}(e)=\\mathrm{Ord}]\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(e)=X\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{dom}(e)\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to e(\\alpha)&lt;e(\\beta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Enum}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\xi\\rangle:\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord},\\ \\xi\\in X,\\ \\operatorname{otp}(X\\cap\\xi,\\in)=\\alpha\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Enum}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\xi\\rangle:\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord},\\ \\xi\\in X,\\ \\operatorname{otp}(X\\cap\\xi,\\in)=\\alpha\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Lemmas 3.2.11–12。关于类函数的 dom/ran 等记号是已声明的元理论类图缩写，不是 ZFC 对真类的集合量化；otp 是集合良序的唯一同构序数。每个 X∩ξ 是集合且被 ∈ 良序，故其序型存在。不同 ξ 的初段序型严格递增，定义单值；集合 X 的定义域为其序型，真类 X 的定义域为 Ord。原稿的集合限定使 Veblen 枚举不合法，现补足类层接口，并避免对类函数作集合层 iota 选择。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"592f91b518237a8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是给定集合或可定义类，$e$ 是可定义部分类函数；$\\mathrm{Ord},<$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]、[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]。类图的 $\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}$ 是元语言缩写，真类不作为 ZFC 集合变量。$A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}$ 为集合，$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in$ 明确表示集合序同构。$\\operatorname{otp}$ 是该唯一序数的可定义类函数，$\\mathrm{Enum}(X)$ 是下式的类图。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"592f91b518237a8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是给定集合或可定义类，$e$ 是可定义部分类函数；$\\mathrm{Ord},<$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]、[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]。类图的 $\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}$ 是元语言缩写，真类不作为 ZFC 集合变量。$A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}$ 为集合，$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in$ 明确表示集合序同构。$\\operatorname{otp}$ 是该唯一序数的可定义类函数，$\\mathrm{Enum}(X)$ 是下式的类图。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord},<","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{otp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Enum}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in(\\alpha,A,h)\\longleftrightarrow\nh:\\alpha\\xrightarrow{\\sim}A\\land\n\\forall\\xi,\\eta\\in\\alpha\\;(\\xi\\in\\eta\\leftrightarrow h(\\xi)\\in h(\\eta)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{otp}(A,\\in)\\coloneqq\\iota\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in(\\alpha,A,h).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncEnum}(X,e)\\longleftrightarrow\n[(\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\operatorname{dom}(e)=\\delta)\\lor\\operatorname{dom}(e)=\\mathrm{Ord}]\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(e)=X\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\operatorname{dom}(e)\\;(\\alpha<\\beta\\to e(\\alpha)<e(\\beta)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Enum}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\xi\\rangle:\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord},\\ \\xi\\in X,\\ \\operatorname{otp}(X\\cap\\xi,\\in)=\\alpha\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2462,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-well-order-enumeration]]"},{"id":"86c6b889a83607ba","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是可定义全类函数，$\\mathrm{Normal}(f)$；$\\mathrm{Normal}$ 见 [[18-df-normal-function]]。$\\mathrm{Fix},\\mathrm{Enum},\\mathrm{IncEnum}$ 分别见 [[18-df-fixed-point-set]]、[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]。"},{"id":"76bd927de48a9849","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\varphi$ 见 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]，$\\mathrm{Enum}$ 见 [[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]。$\\mathrm{SC}$ 是可定义序数类，$\\Gamma$ 是可定义类函数。"},{"id":"d75a0830a7f3ed92","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi=(\\varphi_\\alpha)_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}$ 为候选可定义全类函数族；$\\varphi_\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$，不预先假定正规性。$\\mathrm{Fix},\\mathrm{Enum}$ 见 [[18-df-fixed-point-set]]、[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]。"},{"id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]，$\\omega^\\beta$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]，$\\mathrm{Fix}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Enum}$ 见 [[18-df-fixed-point-set]]、[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]。下列递归定义可定义类图 $\\varphi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}^3$，$\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)$ 表示其唯一值；下标与参数均为序数。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-well-order-enumeration]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-well-order-enumeration]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","592f91b518237a8b"]}